{"id":18130218021,"name":"Hell's Kitchen","desc":"THE DOORS TO HELL 3 ARE OPENING.\n\n🔥Hell's Kitchen 3🔥\n\nWelcome to Hell. Put on your apron and fight to win this season of Hell’s Kitchen. Burn dishes, battle raging fires, and adapt to chaotic wildcard rounds as you master hundreds of new recipes. All under the watchful eye of Gordon, where every mistake earns his wrath!\n\n🧑‍🍳 Core Features:\n- Fire Outbreaks\n- Minigames\n- 5 New Wildcard Rounds\n- Chaos Reigns Supreme In The Kitchen\n- Redesigned Hub, Kitchen And All New Environments\n\nHELL’S KITCHEN, HK and HK pitchfork logo™ and © ITV Studios Ltd; GORDON RAMSAY HELL’S KITCHEN™ and © ITV Studios Limited and Gordon James Ramsay. Each used under licence. All rights reserved.\n\nTags: Cooking, Baking, Food, Restaurant, Kitchen, Chef, Cooking Competition, Challenge, Round Based, Scoring, Eliminations, Survival, Trevguin","path":"/game/18130218021-hell-s-kitchen","slug":"18130218021-hell-s-kitchen","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/18f7ace41ae0cf2f937484132cc441e59ff8c4e013c4c839aaab5342de81cf38.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8a27fe210f8a628edd5b43d50aef7a1c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":152,"visitor":107746532,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-08T23:53:15.437Z","creator":{"name":"ITV","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":1},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"67f5b6eb39e310f562bf8755","title":"auto pantry and fridge","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c789ac","gameId":18130218021,"name":"Hell's Kitchen","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"18130218021-hell-s-kitchen","path":"/game/18130218021-hell-s-kitchen","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":18130218021},"slug":"Hell's-Kitchen-auto-pantry-and-fridge-34796","verified":true,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":47301,"executes":134,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2dc54e0c37d27734f4a58abc4df4600f/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2dc54e0c37d27734f4a58abc4df4600f/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2dc54e0c37d27734f4a58abc4df4600f/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2dc54e0c37d27734f4a58abc4df4600f/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-04-08T23:53:15.437Z","updatedAt":"2025-04-08T23:53:15.437Z","lastBump":"2025-04-08T23:53:15.437Z","script":"local LocalPlayer = game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer\nlocal NextSteps = LocalPlayer.PlayerGui.ScreenGui.NextSteps\nlocal Steps = NextSteps.Steps\nlocal CurrentAction = NextSteps.CurrentAction\n\nlocal function GetCurrentTask()\n    if CurrentAction.Value == 0 then return false end\n    return Steps[tostring(CurrentAction.Value)]\nend\n\nwarn(Action)\nlocal function GetIngredients(CurrentTask)\n    local TempIngredients = CurrentTask.Ingredients:GetChildren()\n    local Ingredients = {}\n    for i,v in pairs(TempIngredients) do\n        if v.ClassName ~= \"Frame\" then continue end\n        local Ingred = v.ViewportFrame:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"Model\")\n        if v.Name == \"Ingredient\" and Ingred then\n            table.insert(Ingredients, Ingred.Name)\n        end\n    end\n    return Ingredients\nend\nlocal function GatherIngredient(dum, IngredientName)\ntask.spawn(function()\nlocal args = {\n    [1] = IngredientName\n}\n\ngame:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"LocalModules\"):WaitForChild(\"LMKitchen\"):WaitForChild(\"ServerRec\"):WaitForChild(\"ObtainFood\"):InvokeServer(unpack(args))\nend)\nend\n\nwhile wait(.1) do\n    local CurrentTask = GetCurrentTask()\n    local Action = CurrentTask.Action.TextLabel.Text\n    warn(Action)\n    if Action == \"Pantry\" or Action == \"Fridge\" then\n        table.foreach(GetIngredients(CurrentTask), GatherIngredient)\n    end\nend","features":"Execute when pre-service starts or whenever, should auto collect ingredients from pantry and fridge\n\nIf it stops working simply execute it again.\n\nWIP","tags":["auto","hub","full","free","keyless"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","username":"Tomato","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98956ce63453a3d326475e182567911881cb1c96f4c90cf0ba0cd6958de8957f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8-1714691274203.png"},"lvl":23,"status":"offline","id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"hall","rank":5,"period":"all","metric":"views","value":11038528}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":10000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98956ce63453a3d326475e182567911881cb1c96f4c90cf0ba0cd6958de8957f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8-1714691274203.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T17:57:19.891Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67f5b6eb39e310f562bf8757","editBy":{"_id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8","username":"Tomato","status":"offline","id":"61ecdfff4351a4a73af593b8"},"message":"Upload Script","createdAt":"2025-04-08T23:53:15.439Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"680a6943349aff89e6eac7bf","commentBy":{"_id":"6808f2520fdc5ac55958e442","username":"Albert_Quandale_IV","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/add223642346e71ac2ef85bd57bf2542d185bedddbd5fb9f8f444d48266e619f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6808f2520fdc5ac55958e442-1748271951311.jpg"},"createdAt":"